{"id": "c-001", "topic": "identity", "type": "constant", "text": "29 岁，在上海，做产品经理五年", "context": "他自述“29 岁，在上海，做产品经理五年了”——五年产品经验意味着熟悉需求侧，缺的是动手。", "source": "user", "confidence": "confirmed", "ambiguous": false, "since": "2026-11-05", "basis": ["f-0004"], "supersedes": [], "status": "active"}
